{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2060,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What would it look like to ride alongside a beam of light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5640,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a question Einstein had asked over a hundred years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9160,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the trouble was, he couldn't actually do the experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11980,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he had to use his imagination;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13980,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he had to do a thought experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15200,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to figure out what a reasonable outcome would be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18580,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I could imagine there'd be some element of nausea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21800,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd imagine everything would get more intense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23980,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe it would confuse the brain; I don't really know if you'd be seeing very much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29140,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was on a water slide just a couple of days ago and I found that really difficult."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34560,
    "dDurationMs": 6540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Einstein's intuition told him that the world should feel the same in all frames of reference moving with constant velocity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41600,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are called inertial frames of reference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44380,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it doesn't matter if you're in a train, or on a plane, or in a car, or in a room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50180,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As long as you're moving with constant velocity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52380,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[All four] The laws of physics should apply in exactly the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55780,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is what's called the principle of relativity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58940,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Is there a speed limit in the universe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60700,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–I don't think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62000,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–You can go as fast as you want?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63360,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Probably"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64260,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Could we go as fast as light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66900,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Ah, I'm sure eventually, absolutely!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68780,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Can you compare the speed of sound and the speed of light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Well, it's however many times quicker, isn't it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73580,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you've got the lightning and thunder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76980,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Roughly how much quicker is light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78760,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Ten times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79460,
    "dDurationMs": 520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Roughly ten times?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80380,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Ten times, I think, is it ten? or a hundred, I don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82700,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83340,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–The answer for you is—a million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85260,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Oh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86240,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Light is a million times faster than sound.(Damn)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88300,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Perhaps thought? or..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90500,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Thought is faster than light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92120,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "–Yeah, it's immediate! it's there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95720,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's do a little thought experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98020,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say I'm on a train travelling the speed of light that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101660,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who am I kidding, this is city rail! We're lucky to be moving.(I looking at you Chicago and New York)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104100,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, let's use our imaginations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105760,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's say I'm travelling at the speed of light this way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108080,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If I hold up a mirror in front of my face,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111280,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will I be able to see my reflection?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114000,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you see the problem?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115220,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In order for me to see my reflection,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117420,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "light has to bounce off my face and travel to the mirror."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120280,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the mirror is going forward at the speed of light,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122940,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how is the light ever going to catch up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126460,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, a logical answer would be that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128980,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no, you can't see your face in a mirror when you're on a train travelling at the speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134420,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that violates the principle of relativity because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137140,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it means that I can tell I'm in a frame of reference that's going at the speed of light that way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141800,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Aw, crap, not again!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143940,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's consider the other option."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146300,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe I do see my reflection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148160,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means the light must travel from my face, to the mirror,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151200,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at its regular speed—the speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153960,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now the problem is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155420,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "someone outside the train would see light travelling at twice the speed of light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159740,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I'm already travelling at the speed of light, and the light is travelling at the speed of light relative to me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165440,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if that makes any sense.(Not really)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167120,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, that leads to a really inconsistent answer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169940,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because how can the speed of light be twice the speed of light in that frame of reference?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174920,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Einstein's conclusion was that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177440,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I must see my reflection; because otherwise, it violates the principle of relativity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181880,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in order for me inside the train to measure the same speed of light as someone outside the train,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188060,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the train must actually contract in the direction that it's moving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191480,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, my time must tick by slower relative to someone outside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197320,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Einstein changed what we thought were absolutes—space and time—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202100,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and made something that seemed like it should be relative—the speed of light—into the true universal constant. (Mind Blown yet?)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208720,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what would it look like to travel alongside a beam of light?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212040,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, according to einstein, we'll never know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214420,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because we can't go that fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217020,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218520,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our length would become zero;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221020,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time would stop relative to an outside observer;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224020,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and perhaps worst of all, our mass would become infinite.(No Mass Effect here guys)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227860,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but a recent experimental result has suggested that neutrinos can go faster than light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233100,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, most physicists think that, well, this result probably won't hold up to scrutiny"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238000,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the principle of relativity is just so well established nowadays."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242700,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But who knows! Perhaps one day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244840,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'll find a way to break what we thought was the universal speed limit—the speed of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250480,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Subtitles: Thomas Martinez"
    } ]
  } ]
}
